Descriptor GradingPeriod
    documentation 'This descriptor defines the name of the period for which grades are reported. 
                  'The mapping of descriptor values to known Ed-Fi enumeration values is required.
    with map type
        item First Six Weeks
        item Second Six Weeks
        item Third Six Weeks
        item Fourth Six Weeks
        item Fifth Six Weeks
        item Sixth Six Weeks
        item First Semester
        item Second Semester
        item First Summer Session
        item Second Summer Session
        item Third Summer Session
        item Summer Semester
        item First Nine Weeks
        item Second Nine Weeks
        item Third Nine Weeks
        item Fourth Nine Weeks
        item First Trimester
        item Second Trimester
        item Third Trimester
        item End of Year